SUMMARY:Salsa Night I Black & White Affair I May Birthday Celebrations!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nSALSA NIGHT!\nMAY 
 BIRTHDAYS BLACK & WHITE AFFAIR Salsa4Life Wednesdays – This One’s Spec
 ial\n\nCelebrating Clara's Birthday and all May Babies!:)\nCome dressed to
  impress… it’s giving class\, confidence\, and celebration ALL night l
 ong.\n\nCome early—doors open at 7:15 PM for our Meet & Greet Mixer\nGet
  in\, connect\, vibe… then hit the floor!\n\nDance • Drink • Connect
 \n\nSalsa & Bachata Lesson \\| 7:30–8:30 PM\nBeginner-friendly • No pa
 rtner needed\nPull up solo\, leave with new moves\n\nBirthday Vibes & Danc
 e + Door Prizes!\nStick around—you might just win something nice\n\nSoci
 al Dancing \\| 8:30–11:30 PM\n\nDJ Giovanni spinning Salsa • Bachata 
 • Latin Hits\nNon-stop energy.\n\nDrink specials all night\n\nAir-condit
 ioned (stay cool while it gets HOT on the floor)\nSpacious dance floor = r
 oom to shine\nFree parking = no excuses\n\n$10 before 9PM (Early Bird Move
  Smart!)\n$15 after 9PM\n\nKōMANA Brewing Co. – Cary\, NC\n18\\+ to par
 ty \\| 21\\+ to drink\n\nMAY BIRTHDAYS — THIS IS YOUR NIGHT\nCelebrate b
 ig. Dance bold. Show OUT in black & white.\nGrab your crew… or come solo
  and leave with a whole new circle.\nWednesdays just became the night you 
 don’t miss.\n\n[https://www.facebook.com/share/1CPLLw73Dh/](https://www.
 facebook.com/share/1CPLLw73Dh/)\nsalsa4life.com\n\nGrab your friends and m
 ake Wednesdays your favorite night of the week! 💃🕺\n[Follow us on fb
  ](Facebook.com/salsa4lifenc)\nFollow us on fb Salsa4lifenc or instagram s
 alsa4life_com
